{"id":"lv8gcj7eosxjvwimaryb68dbm","title":"人类与AI协作为何需要超越任务分配","originalTitle":"New research shows why human–AI collaboration requires more than task allocation","summary":"一项2026年发表在《战略管理杂志》的研究发现，成功的人工智能协作依赖于组织如何整合人类和AI之间根本不同的知识形式。研究指出，通过分配工作、知识转换和迭代引导AI，可以克服认知不对称带来的挑战。研究成果为管理者提供了组织人类与AI协作的框架，强调了将AI输出转化为人类可理解的上下文的重要性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-humanai-collaboration-requires-task-allocation.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T20:20:12.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T20:25:35.929Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T20:25:35.929Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind"],"score":40,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"f12c9065-e721-4355-ba45-fdc722410d93","title":"人类与AI协作需整合知识形式，研究提出框架"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"f12c9065-e721-4355-ba45-fdc722410d93","title":"人类与AI协作需整合知识形式，研究提出框架"}],"topics":[{"slug":"deepmind","name":"DeepMind"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"frTezohm54lM","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}